1
00:00:00,260 --> 00:00:01,560
Let's get AutoLander ready

2
00:00:01,560 --> 00:00:02,920
on your Windows or Mac

3
00:00:02,920 --> 00:00:04,240
laptop or desktop.

4
00:00:04,900 --> 00:00:06,720
Open autolander dot ai.

5
00:00:06,920 --> 00:00:08,350
At the top right,

6
00:00:08,370 --> 00:00:09,670
next to Book a Demo,

7
00:00:09,670 --> 00:00:10,710
choose Download.

8
00:00:11,520 --> 00:00:12,560
On Windows, you

9
00:00:12,560 --> 00:00:13,920
may see a security prompt.

10
00:00:14,100 --> 00:00:16,120
First, confirm the installer

11
00:00:16,120 --> 00:00:18,040
came from AutoLander.ai.

12
00:00:18,220 --> 00:00:19,470
If your browser

13
00:00:19,470 --> 00:00:20,530
blocks the download,

14
00:00:20,650 --> 00:00:22,350
open Downloads and choose Keep

15
00:00:22,350 --> 00:00:23,950
only for that trusted file.

16
00:00:24,490 --> 00:00:26,130
Choose Show in Folder,

17
00:00:26,130 --> 00:00:27,870
or Open Containing Folder,

18
00:00:27,870 --> 00:00:29,050
then open the installer.

19
00:00:29,570 --> 00:00:30,650
If Windows says,

20
00:00:30,650 --> 00:00:32,490
Windows protected your PC,

21
00:00:32,730 --> 00:00:34,930
choose More info, then Run

22
00:00:34,930 --> 00:00:36,810
anyway, if offered and allowed

23
00:00:36,810 --> 00:00:37,830
by your organization.

24
00:00:38,100 --> 00:00:39,380
The next screens

25
00:00:39,380 --> 00:00:40,400
are normal setup.

26
00:00:40,800 --> 00:00:42,500
Choose Only for me unless

27
00:00:42,500 --> 00:00:44,160
your IT team says otherwise,

28
00:00:44,230 --> 00:00:45,250
then Next.

29
00:00:45,280 --> 00:00:46,370
Keep the default

30
00:00:46,370 --> 00:00:47,710
folder and click Install.

31
00:00:47,870 --> 00:00:49,220
When it finishes,

32
00:00:49,260 --> 00:00:50,800
leave Run AutoLander

33
00:00:50,800 --> 00:00:52,300
checked and click Finish.

34
00:00:52,600 --> 00:00:54,100
These Windows steps do

35
00:00:54,100 --> 00:00:55,140
not apply on Mac.

36
00:00:55,470 --> 00:00:56,650
If a malware alert

37
00:00:56,650 --> 00:00:57,790
or company policy

38
00:00:57,790 --> 00:00:58,850
blocks installation,

39
00:00:59,090 --> 00:01:00,790
stop and ask for help.

40
00:01:01,220 --> 00:01:02,520
Once the app opens,

41
00:01:02,560 --> 00:01:04,140
you'll see this login screen.

42
00:01:04,360 --> 00:01:06,310
If your dealership invited you,

43
00:01:06,310 --> 00:01:07,380
use the details

44
00:01:07,380 --> 00:01:08,700
in your AutoLander email.

45
00:01:08,990 --> 00:01:10,010
Check your spam

46
00:01:10,010 --> 00:01:11,080
folder if it's missing,

47
00:01:11,080 --> 00:01:12,300
then ask your manager.

48
00:01:12,730 --> 00:01:14,590
This is your AutoLander login,

49
00:01:14,690 --> 00:01:16,290
not your Facebook password.

50
00:01:16,740 --> 00:01:17,760
We'll connect Facebook

51
00:01:17,760 --> 00:01:18,780
separately after

52
00:01:18,780 --> 00:01:19,800
you're signed in.

53
00:01:19,800 --> 00:01:21,560
Keep both passwords private.

54
00:01:22,170 --> 00:01:23,430
Moving to another computer?

55
00:01:23,690 --> 00:01:24,710
Sign in to

56
00:01:24,710 --> 00:01:25,730
your existing account.

57
00:01:26,020 --> 00:01:27,100
Forgot password

58
00:01:27,100 --> 00:01:28,410
is below Sign In.

59
00:01:28,410 --> 00:01:29,430
If you're setting

60
00:01:29,430 --> 00:01:30,450
up your own account

61
00:01:30,450 --> 00:01:31,470
for the first time,

62
00:01:31,470 --> 00:01:33,220
choose Register below Sign

63
00:01:33,220 --> 00:01:35,000
In and follow the instructions.

64
00:01:35,260 --> 00:01:36,310
You can review

65
00:01:36,310 --> 00:01:37,870
plans inside the app.

66
00:01:38,267 --> 00:01:39,197
Once you're signed

67
00:01:39,197 --> 00:01:40,457
in, look at the bottom

68
00:01:40,457 --> 00:01:42,277
left of the AutoLander sidebar.

69
00:01:42,717 --> 00:01:44,337
Product Tour is right here.

70
00:01:44,477 --> 00:01:45,657
Use it whenever you

71
00:01:45,657 --> 00:01:46,977
need help finding a feature.

72
00:01:47,367 --> 00:01:48,597
Before moving on,

73
00:01:48,597 --> 00:01:49,807
make sure you know which

74
00:01:49,807 --> 00:01:51,067
login path is yours.

75
00:01:52,337 --> 00:01:53,477
Start on Sales Hub.

76
00:01:53,517 --> 00:01:55,077
This is your overview.

77
00:01:55,237 --> 00:01:56,917
Read the labels beside the

78
00:01:56,917 --> 00:01:58,157
numbers so you know whether

79
00:01:58,157 --> 00:01:59,457
you're looking at inventory,

80
00:01:59,457 --> 00:02:01,207
posting activity or something

81
00:02:01,207 --> 00:02:02,227
that needs attention.

82
00:02:02,837 --> 00:02:03,857
The main navigation

83
00:02:03,857 --> 00:02:05,047
stays on the left.

84
00:02:05,347 --> 00:02:06,607
Move down to Post

85
00:02:06,607 --> 00:02:08,127
to Market and click it.

86
00:02:08,127 --> 00:02:09,147
This is where

87
00:02:09,147 --> 00:02:10,347
you'll find your vehicles.

88
00:02:10,547 --> 00:02:13,027
Available, Queue and Posted

89
00:02:13,027 --> 00:02:14,287
to FB sit across the

90
00:02:14,287 --> 00:02:15,447
top of the working area.

91
00:02:15,887 --> 00:02:17,427
They separate vehicles you

92
00:02:17,427 --> 00:02:19,247
can choose, work in progress,

93
00:02:19,347 --> 00:02:20,787
and listings you've posted.

94
00:02:20,787 --> 00:02:22,957
Next, click Listing

95
00:02:22,957 --> 00:02:24,497
Updates in the left sidebar.

96
00:02:24,907 --> 00:02:26,427
This page brings together

97
00:02:26,427 --> 00:02:27,917
price changes and vehicles

98
00:02:27,917 --> 00:02:28,937
that are no longer

99
00:02:28,937 --> 00:02:30,177
in the connected inventory.

100
00:02:30,627 --> 00:02:32,187
Now click Configuration.

101
00:02:32,267 --> 00:02:34,247
The tabs here include Facebook,

102
00:02:34,367 --> 00:02:36,547
Inventory Feeds and Post Style.

103
00:02:36,717 --> 00:02:37,737
You'll use these

104
00:02:37,737 --> 00:02:38,757
for your connections

105
00:02:38,757 --> 00:02:39,777
and listing settings.

106
00:02:39,877 --> 00:02:40,897
Other tabs

107
00:02:40,897 --> 00:02:41,947
depend on your access.

108
00:02:42,387 --> 00:02:43,567
Product Tour is at

109
00:02:43,567 --> 00:02:44,987
the bottom left, and Support

110
00:02:44,987 --> 00:02:46,487
is also in the sidebar.

111
00:02:46,717 --> 00:02:47,737
Pause the video

112
00:02:47,737 --> 00:02:49,207
and find those four destinations

113
00:02:49,207 --> 00:02:51,217
yourself: Post to Market,

114
00:02:51,237 --> 00:02:52,297
Listing Updates,

115
00:02:52,437 --> 00:02:54,537
Configuration and Product Tour.

116
00:02:54,537 --> 00:02:55,557
You don't need

117
00:02:55,557 --> 00:02:56,577
to change anything.

118
00:02:57,793 --> 00:02:59,133
Before your first post,

119
00:02:59,173 --> 00:03:00,953
connect the Facebook profile you

120
00:03:00,953 --> 00:03:02,033
use for Marketplace.

121
00:03:02,383 --> 00:03:04,643
Start in AutoLander, move

122
00:03:04,643 --> 00:03:06,083
to Configuration in the left

123
00:03:06,083 --> 00:03:07,483
sidebar, and click it.

124
00:03:07,573 --> 00:03:09,373
Then select the Facebook tab.

125
00:03:09,703 --> 00:03:10,723
If this is

126
00:03:10,723 --> 00:03:11,743
your first connection,

127
00:03:11,743 --> 00:03:13,023
choose Connect Facebook.

128
00:03:13,573 --> 00:03:14,713
Follow the sign-in

129
00:03:14,713 --> 00:03:16,033
steps with your own personal

130
00:03:16,033 --> 00:03:17,093
Marketplace profile,

131
00:03:17,293 --> 00:03:19,193
not a dealership Business Page.

132
00:03:19,573 --> 00:03:20,733
Enter your password

133
00:03:20,733 --> 00:03:22,673
and any security code privately.

134
00:03:22,673 --> 00:03:25,013
If Facebook says that profile

135
00:03:25,013 --> 00:03:26,453
cannot use Marketplace,

136
00:03:26,533 --> 00:03:28,193
resolve that access issue

137
00:03:28,193 --> 00:03:29,753
with Facebook before trying

138
00:03:29,753 --> 00:03:31,093
to post through AutoLander.

139
00:03:31,133 --> 00:03:33,643
When you return to AutoLander,

140
00:03:33,663 --> 00:03:34,963
check the connection status.

141
00:03:35,303 --> 00:03:37,143
After setup, the Facebook

142
00:03:37,143 --> 00:03:38,643
Connected indicator at the top

143
00:03:38,643 --> 00:03:39,983
right is a quick place

144
00:03:39,983 --> 00:03:41,343
to check before you work.

145
00:03:41,503 --> 00:03:42,523
It tells you

146
00:03:42,523 --> 00:03:43,543
about the connection,

147
00:03:43,543 --> 00:03:44,723
not whether a particular

148
00:03:44,723 --> 00:03:46,343
vehicle has finished posting.

149
00:03:46,503 --> 00:03:48,683
If the session expires later,

150
00:03:48,783 --> 00:03:50,103
return to Configuration,

151
00:03:50,483 --> 00:03:51,543
open Facebook,

152
00:03:51,543 --> 00:03:53,543
and choose Reconnect Facebook.

153
00:03:53,543 --> 00:03:55,673
Finish the sign-in steps,

154
00:03:55,753 --> 00:03:57,373
then check the status again.

155
00:03:57,653 --> 00:03:59,073
There's no need to disconnect

156
00:03:59,073 --> 00:04:00,353
a working account just

157
00:04:00,353 --> 00:04:01,453
to follow this lesson.

158
00:04:01,513 --> 00:04:02,773
For practice,

159
00:04:02,813 --> 00:04:03,993
locate the Facebook

160
00:04:03,993 --> 00:04:05,433
tab and the top-right

161
00:04:05,433 --> 00:04:06,453
connection indicator.

162
00:04:06,633 --> 00:04:07,763
If the connection

163
00:04:07,763 --> 00:04:09,313
still won't complete, show

164
00:04:09,313 --> 00:04:10,553
the message to your manager

165
00:04:10,553 --> 00:04:11,573
on a dealer account,

166
00:04:11,573 --> 00:04:13,263
or contact the AutoLander

167
00:04:13,263 --> 00:04:14,403
admin through Support

168
00:04:14,403 --> 00:04:15,743
on an individual account.

169
00:04:17,027 --> 00:04:18,207
Click Post to Market

170
00:04:18,207 --> 00:04:19,257
in the left sidebar,

171
00:04:19,257 --> 00:04:20,787
then choose Available.

172
00:04:21,117 --> 00:04:22,137
First, make

173
00:04:22,137 --> 00:04:23,207
sure these are vehicles

174
00:04:23,207 --> 00:04:24,727
from the dealership and location

175
00:04:24,727 --> 00:04:25,987
you intend to advertise.

176
00:04:26,267 --> 00:04:28,277
If the inventory looks wrong,

177
00:04:28,317 --> 00:04:29,557
don't start a post.

178
00:04:29,697 --> 00:04:30,997
On a dealer account,

179
00:04:31,067 --> 00:04:32,087
tell your manager.

180
00:04:32,387 --> 00:04:33,827
On an individual account,

181
00:04:33,947 --> 00:04:35,347
contact the AutoLander

182
00:04:35,347 --> 00:04:36,627
admin through Support.

183
00:04:37,307 --> 00:04:38,607
Use the search box

184
00:04:38,607 --> 00:04:39,727
or the filters above

185
00:04:39,727 --> 00:04:40,757
the vehicles to find

186
00:04:40,757 --> 00:04:41,777
the car you want.

187
00:04:42,057 --> 00:04:43,177
Check its identity,

188
00:04:43,277 --> 00:04:44,887
price and mileage against

189
00:04:44,887 --> 00:04:46,227
the dealership's information.

190
00:04:46,227 --> 00:04:47,617
The photos

191
00:04:47,617 --> 00:04:49,217
come from your inventory source;

192
00:04:49,377 --> 00:04:50,557
an AI option

193
00:04:50,557 --> 00:04:51,737
doesn't correct missing

194
00:04:51,737 --> 00:04:53,537
or inaccurate source details.

195
00:04:53,757 --> 00:04:55,227
Click the selection

196
00:04:55,227 --> 00:04:56,607
box on a vehicle card.

197
00:04:56,687 --> 00:04:58,187
You can select more than

198
00:04:58,187 --> 00:04:59,447
one, and the Post

199
00:04:59,447 --> 00:05:00,747
to Marketplace button shows

200
00:05:00,747 --> 00:05:01,847
how many you've chosen.

201
00:05:02,147 --> 00:05:03,167
Keep the cards

202
00:05:03,167 --> 00:05:04,297
and that button in view

203
00:05:04,297 --> 00:05:05,677
while you check the selection.

204
00:05:06,027 --> 00:05:07,867
Leave AI Background off

205
00:05:07,867 --> 00:05:09,367
to use the original photos,

206
00:05:09,447 --> 00:05:10,807
or choose an optional

207
00:05:10,807 --> 00:05:11,927
treatment after checking

208
00:05:11,927 --> 00:05:13,367
its displayed credit cost.

209
00:05:13,547 --> 00:05:14,567
We'll cover those

210
00:05:14,567 --> 00:05:15,927
choices in the AI lesson.

211
00:05:15,927 --> 00:05:17,207
When you're ready

212
00:05:17,207 --> 00:05:18,287
for an intended post,

213
00:05:18,387 --> 00:05:20,207
click Post to Marketplace.

214
00:05:20,257 --> 00:05:21,277
The work

215
00:05:21,277 --> 00:05:22,297
moves to the Queue.

216
00:05:22,427 --> 00:05:23,957
For this practice,

217
00:05:23,997 --> 00:05:25,177
select one suitable

218
00:05:25,177 --> 00:05:26,957
vehicle and explain your checks.

219
00:05:27,117 --> 00:05:28,197
You can stop

220
00:05:28,197 --> 00:05:29,397
before the posting button.

221
00:05:30,493 --> 00:05:31,673
After starting a post,

222
00:05:31,753 --> 00:05:32,973
look at the Queue tab

223
00:05:32,973 --> 00:05:34,253
in Post to Market.

224
00:05:34,653 --> 00:05:35,733
Read the status

225
00:05:35,733 --> 00:05:36,773
on each vehicle.

226
00:05:37,373 --> 00:05:39,333
Preparing or processing means

227
00:05:39,333 --> 00:05:40,693
the work is still underway.

228
00:05:41,553 --> 00:05:42,793
Published means that

229
00:05:42,793 --> 00:05:44,333
vehicle has finished posting.

230
00:05:44,883 --> 00:05:46,503
If a row says Failed,

231
00:05:46,563 --> 00:05:47,863
read its message before

232
00:05:47,863 --> 00:05:49,203
starting anything again.

233
00:05:49,903 --> 00:05:51,103
Here's a batch with two

234
00:05:51,103 --> 00:05:52,153
published and four

235
00:05:52,153 --> 00:05:53,173
still remaining.

236
00:05:53,453 --> 00:05:54,753
That isn't a completed

237
00:05:54,753 --> 00:05:55,813
six-vehicle batch.

238
00:05:55,973 --> 00:05:57,223
Keep the computer

239
00:05:57,223 --> 00:05:58,943
online and AutoLander

240
00:05:58,943 --> 00:06:00,163
running while it works.

241
00:06:00,203 --> 00:06:01,923
You can do other tasks

242
00:06:01,923 --> 00:06:03,603
and check back; you don't

243
00:06:03,603 --> 00:06:04,773
need to watch every step.

244
00:06:04,843 --> 00:06:06,233
To review listings

245
00:06:06,233 --> 00:06:08,233
you've posted, click Posted

246
00:06:08,233 --> 00:06:09,873
to FB beside Queue.

247
00:06:10,193 --> 00:06:11,213
Find the vehicle

248
00:06:11,213 --> 00:06:12,233
you want to check.

249
00:06:12,233 --> 00:06:13,553
You can also open

250
00:06:13,553 --> 00:06:14,723
your Facebook Marketplace

251
00:06:14,723 --> 00:06:15,893
listings and check

252
00:06:15,893 --> 00:06:17,173
the matching vehicle there.

253
00:06:17,683 --> 00:06:18,863
Confirm its price,

254
00:06:18,883 --> 00:06:20,503
description and availability,

255
00:06:20,723 --> 00:06:22,323
rather than relying only

256
00:06:22,323 --> 00:06:23,983
on a total in AutoLander.

257
00:06:24,023 --> 00:06:25,283
If a vehicle

258
00:06:25,283 --> 00:06:26,303
is still waiting,

259
00:06:26,303 --> 00:06:27,603
don't add it again just

260
00:06:27,603 --> 00:06:28,903
because it's taking a while.

261
00:06:29,313 --> 00:06:31,113
Check the existing job first.

262
00:06:31,493 --> 00:06:32,853
Pause on this example.

263
00:06:33,293 --> 00:06:34,773
Which vehicles are done,

264
00:06:34,813 --> 00:06:36,093
which are still working,

265
00:06:36,093 --> 00:06:37,113
and which message

266
00:06:37,113 --> 00:06:38,313
would need your attention?

267
00:06:39,393 --> 00:06:40,493
From Post to Market,

268
00:06:40,533 --> 00:06:41,673
click Listing

269
00:06:41,673 --> 00:06:43,053
Updates in the left sidebar.

270
00:06:43,113 --> 00:06:44,313
Here are real

271
00:06:44,313 --> 00:06:45,923
price changes and vehicles

272
00:06:45,923 --> 00:06:46,943
that are no longer

273
00:06:46,943 --> 00:06:48,183
in the connected inventory.

274
00:06:48,753 --> 00:06:50,233
Start with a price card.

275
00:06:50,333 --> 00:06:51,573
Compare the old price

276
00:06:51,573 --> 00:06:52,653
with the new one.

277
00:06:52,963 --> 00:06:54,103
On a sold card,

278
00:06:54,153 --> 00:06:55,173
check the vehicle

279
00:06:55,173 --> 00:06:56,443
and the action shown.

280
00:06:56,803 --> 00:06:58,363
Choose individual vehicles

281
00:06:58,363 --> 00:06:59,903
using their selection boxes.

282
00:07:00,313 --> 00:07:01,593
Or, if you want

283
00:07:01,593 --> 00:07:03,013
to handle every change shown,

284
00:07:03,113 --> 00:07:04,253
use Select

285
00:07:04,253 --> 00:07:05,373
All at the bottom.

286
00:07:05,833 --> 00:07:07,313
Check the selected count.

287
00:07:07,433 --> 00:07:09,573
Then click Process Updates.

288
00:07:09,573 --> 00:07:10,603
The Queue

289
00:07:10,603 --> 00:07:12,043
shows the work in progress.

290
00:07:12,243 --> 00:07:14,343
In this example, AutoLander

291
00:07:14,343 --> 00:07:16,103
is marking one vehicle sold.

292
00:07:16,163 --> 00:07:17,193
Watch for Done

293
00:07:17,193 --> 00:07:18,213
on that row.

294
00:07:18,213 --> 00:07:19,233
That confirms

295
00:07:19,233 --> 00:07:20,253
the action finished.

296
00:07:20,593 --> 00:07:21,633
After a price

297
00:07:21,633 --> 00:07:23,153
update finishes successfully,

298
00:07:23,293 --> 00:07:24,513
the matching Facebook

299
00:07:24,513 --> 00:07:26,133
listing shows the new price.

300
00:07:26,273 --> 00:07:28,173
If a row says Failed,

301
00:07:28,173 --> 00:07:29,193
read its message

302
00:07:29,193 --> 00:07:30,233
before trying again.

303
00:07:30,493 --> 00:07:31,913
Using Auto-Pilot?

304
00:07:31,913 --> 00:07:33,153
It handles price

305
00:07:33,153 --> 00:07:34,243
and sold updates

306
00:07:34,243 --> 00:07:35,483
for you while it's running.

307
00:07:35,483 --> 00:07:36,503
You don't have

308
00:07:36,503 --> 00:07:37,533
to keep this page open

309
00:07:37,533 --> 00:07:38,953
or watch each update.

310
00:07:38,953 --> 00:07:40,783
If you're posting manually,

311
00:07:40,903 --> 00:07:42,803
check Listing Updates as part

312
00:07:42,803 --> 00:07:43,823
of your daily routine.

313
00:07:44,203 --> 00:07:46,403
Now find one price change,

314
00:07:46,523 --> 00:07:47,783
one sold card

315
00:07:47,803 --> 00:07:49,203
and the selection controls.

316
00:07:49,443 --> 00:07:50,563
If your page

317
00:07:50,563 --> 00:07:51,843
has no changes today,

318
00:07:51,943 --> 00:07:53,283
there's nothing to process.

319
00:07:54,560 --> 00:07:55,880
Before you start a run,

320
00:07:55,920 --> 00:07:57,540
make five quick checks.

321
00:07:57,920 --> 00:07:59,770
First, are you signed into

322
00:07:59,770 --> 00:08:01,070
the right AutoLander account

323
00:08:01,070 --> 00:08:02,490
with access to the work

324
00:08:02,490 --> 00:08:03,510
you're about to do?

325
00:08:03,980 --> 00:08:06,060
Second, is Facebook connected?

326
00:08:06,440 --> 00:08:07,610
Check the indicator

327
00:08:07,610 --> 00:08:08,630
at the top right.

328
00:08:08,630 --> 00:08:10,600
If it needs attention, go

329
00:08:10,600 --> 00:08:12,730
to Configuration, then Facebook,

330
00:08:12,730 --> 00:08:14,360
and follow the connection steps.

331
00:08:15,240 --> 00:08:17,420
Third, is the inventory right?

332
00:08:17,880 --> 00:08:19,200
Open Post to Market

333
00:08:19,200 --> 00:08:20,340
and look for a few

334
00:08:20,340 --> 00:08:21,520
vehicles you recognize

335
00:08:21,520 --> 00:08:23,000
from the correct dealership.

336
00:08:23,000 --> 00:08:24,040
If you're

337
00:08:24,040 --> 00:08:25,260
setting up your own feed,

338
00:08:25,280 --> 00:08:26,420
the inventory lesson

339
00:08:26,420 --> 00:08:27,800
shows the connection steps.

340
00:08:28,200 --> 00:08:29,560
If your dealership

341
00:08:29,560 --> 00:08:30,760
already manages it,

342
00:08:30,760 --> 00:08:32,340
use that existing feed.

343
00:08:33,270 --> 00:08:34,290
Fourth, is

344
00:08:34,290 --> 00:08:35,810
the vehicle ready to advertise?

345
00:08:36,450 --> 00:08:38,250
Check its price and mileage,

346
00:08:38,330 --> 00:08:40,290
your selection count, and any

347
00:08:40,290 --> 00:08:41,970
optional AI credit cost.

348
00:08:42,580 --> 00:08:43,660
Resolve incorrect

349
00:08:43,660 --> 00:08:45,620
information before posting it.

350
00:08:46,360 --> 00:08:48,340
Fifth, is the computer online

351
00:08:48,340 --> 00:08:49,800
with AutoLander running?

352
00:08:49,860 --> 00:08:52,490
If you use Auto-Pilot, check

353
00:08:52,490 --> 00:08:53,870
that it's on and configured

354
00:08:53,870 --> 00:08:55,110
for the window you want.

355
00:08:55,110 --> 00:08:57,040
Now read any

356
00:08:57,040 --> 00:08:58,180
unfinished Queue item

357
00:08:58,180 --> 00:08:59,640
before starting another job.

358
00:08:59,760 --> 00:09:00,960
If something

359
00:09:00,960 --> 00:09:02,000
still doesn't match,

360
00:09:02,060 --> 00:09:03,580
you've narrowed down the issue.

361
00:09:04,220 --> 00:09:05,860
Dealer-account users can

362
00:09:05,860 --> 00:09:07,120
take that specific problem

363
00:09:07,120 --> 00:09:08,940
to their manager; individual

364
00:09:08,940 --> 00:09:11,200
users can contact the AutoLander

365
00:09:11,200 --> 00:09:12,400
admin through Support.

366
00:09:12,960 --> 00:09:14,640
Pause and do those five

367
00:09:14,640 --> 00:09:16,000
checks on your own screen.

368
00:09:16,440 --> 00:09:17,660
Write down only

369
00:09:17,660 --> 00:09:19,040
the item that needs attention.

370
00:09:20,193 --> 00:09:21,453
Your inventory feed

371
00:09:21,453 --> 00:09:22,693
brings the dealership's

372
00:09:22,693 --> 00:09:24,193
vehicles into AutoLander.

373
00:09:24,213 --> 00:09:26,013
If your manager has already

374
00:09:26,013 --> 00:09:27,313
connected the right feed,

375
00:09:27,353 --> 00:09:28,413
keep that connection.

376
00:09:28,533 --> 00:09:29,553
You only need

377
00:09:29,553 --> 00:09:30,573
to check the vehicles.

378
00:09:30,613 --> 00:09:32,133
To add your own source,

379
00:09:32,213 --> 00:09:33,753
start in the left sidebar.

380
00:09:33,793 --> 00:09:35,553
Click Configuration.

381
00:09:35,783 --> 00:09:37,183
Across the top of that

382
00:09:37,183 --> 00:09:39,513
page, choose Inventory Feeds.

383
00:09:39,513 --> 00:09:41,423
Then click Add Feed.

384
00:09:41,563 --> 00:09:42,963
You'll see two routes:

385
00:09:43,143 --> 00:09:45,323
Website Scrape and Data Feed.

386
00:09:45,683 --> 00:09:46,943
Let's start with a website.

387
00:09:46,943 --> 00:09:48,773
For Cars dot com

388
00:09:48,773 --> 00:09:50,583
or CarGurus, copy

389
00:09:50,583 --> 00:09:52,053
the address of your dealership's

390
00:09:52,053 --> 00:09:53,073
inventory page.

391
00:09:53,363 --> 00:09:55,683
Back in AutoLander, choose Enter

392
00:09:55,683 --> 00:09:57,923
a URL under Website Scrape.

393
00:09:58,073 --> 00:09:59,093
Paste that address

394
00:09:59,093 --> 00:10:00,413
into Website URL.

395
00:10:00,553 --> 00:10:01,573
You can add

396
00:10:01,573 --> 00:10:02,683
the dealer name as well.

397
00:10:02,893 --> 00:10:03,913
Click Verify

398
00:10:03,913 --> 00:10:05,203
and read the result.

399
00:10:05,523 --> 00:10:06,883
When the source is ready,

400
00:10:06,883 --> 00:10:08,743
choose Connect Website.

401
00:10:08,743 --> 00:10:10,853
For a custom dealership website,

402
00:10:11,153 --> 00:10:12,713
first ask AutoLander

403
00:10:12,713 --> 00:10:14,153
to confirm that it's supported.

404
00:10:14,313 --> 00:10:15,613
Now look at Data Feed.

405
00:10:15,613 --> 00:10:17,573
This route uses inventory

406
00:10:17,573 --> 00:10:19,113
supplied by your provider.

407
00:10:19,173 --> 00:10:20,663
They can send a file,

408
00:10:20,663 --> 00:10:21,913
provide a feed link,

409
00:10:21,913 --> 00:10:23,913
or use the SFTP option.

410
00:10:24,113 --> 00:10:25,133
On a dealer

411
00:10:25,133 --> 00:10:26,153
or team plan,

412
00:10:26,163 --> 00:10:27,583
AutoLander can help arrange

413
00:10:27,583 --> 00:10:28,883
a connection with a provider

414
00:10:28,883 --> 00:10:30,023
such as vAuto.

415
00:10:30,283 --> 00:10:31,303
Have that connection

416
00:10:31,303 --> 00:10:32,373
set up with the correct

417
00:10:32,373 --> 00:10:33,863
details before using it.

418
00:10:34,093 --> 00:10:35,493
When the inventory loads,

419
00:10:35,673 --> 00:10:37,353
click Post to Market

420
00:10:37,353 --> 00:10:38,453
in the sidebar.

421
00:10:38,743 --> 00:10:39,783
Check the location

422
00:10:39,783 --> 00:10:41,263
and three familiar vehicles.

423
00:10:41,323 --> 00:10:42,343
Do their

424
00:10:42,343 --> 00:10:43,453
prices and mileage match

425
00:10:43,453 --> 00:10:44,833
your dealership's information?

426
00:10:44,833 --> 00:10:46,923
Clear the search or filters

427
00:10:46,923 --> 00:10:48,683
if expected vehicles are hidden.

428
00:10:48,683 --> 00:10:50,333
If the source is wrong,

429
00:10:50,413 --> 00:10:51,693
dealer-account users

430
00:10:51,693 --> 00:10:52,913
should tell their manager.

431
00:10:53,193 --> 00:10:54,733
Individual users should

432
00:10:54,733 --> 00:10:56,413
contact the AutoLander admin.

433
00:10:56,843 --> 00:10:58,443
In your workbook, note

434
00:10:58,443 --> 00:10:59,613
your source and the three

435
00:10:59,613 --> 00:11:00,633
vehicles you checked.

436
00:11:01,760 --> 00:11:02,940
Click Configuration

437
00:11:02,940 --> 00:11:03,960
in the sidebar,

438
00:11:03,960 --> 00:11:05,700
then open Post Style.

439
00:11:05,980 --> 00:11:07,080
This is where you

440
00:11:07,080 --> 00:11:08,370
shape the wording that goes

441
00:11:08,370 --> 00:11:09,750
with your vehicle information.

442
00:11:10,240 --> 00:11:12,300
Start with Dealer Playbook.

443
00:11:12,750 --> 00:11:13,780
Look at the example

444
00:11:13,780 --> 00:11:14,800
in the app,

445
00:11:14,800 --> 00:11:16,590
then replace it with clear

446
00:11:16,590 --> 00:11:18,290
information your dealership

447
00:11:18,290 --> 00:11:20,150
actually wants buyers to read.

448
00:11:21,540 --> 00:11:23,380
Managers and admins set

449
00:11:23,380 --> 00:11:24,820
the shared dealership wording,

450
00:11:24,840 --> 00:11:26,160
so agree on it before

451
00:11:26,160 --> 00:11:27,460
changing it for the team.

452
00:11:27,860 --> 00:11:28,880
For example:

453
00:11:28,880 --> 00:11:30,530
Financing available.

454
00:11:30,530 --> 00:11:31,930
Trade-ins welcome.

455
00:11:32,290 --> 00:11:33,450
We speak Spanish.

456
00:11:33,450 --> 00:11:34,880
Use only

457
00:11:34,880 --> 00:11:36,300
statements your store has

458
00:11:36,300 --> 00:11:38,300
approved and services it offers.

459
00:11:38,400 --> 00:11:40,720
Add the dealership's approved

460
00:11:40,720 --> 00:11:42,360
fee wording where appropriate;

461
00:11:42,520 --> 00:11:44,360
don't copy another store's

462
00:11:44,360 --> 00:11:45,740
fees into your own listings.

463
00:11:46,400 --> 00:11:47,480
Check for spelling

464
00:11:47,480 --> 00:11:49,100
mistakes and repeated lines

465
00:11:49,100 --> 00:11:50,640
before saving your changes.

466
00:11:52,060 --> 00:11:53,460
My Listing Additions

467
00:11:53,460 --> 00:11:55,130
is your closing information at

468
00:11:55,130 --> 00:11:56,510
the bottom of the description.

469
00:11:56,900 --> 00:11:57,920
You could write:

470
00:11:58,100 --> 00:11:59,620
Please message me for more

471
00:11:59,620 --> 00:12:00,790
pictures and information.

472
00:12:00,940 --> 00:12:01,960
My phone number

473
00:12:01,960 --> 00:12:02,980
is in my bio.

474
00:12:03,280 --> 00:12:04,720
Then include your approved

475
00:12:04,720 --> 00:12:05,740
contact email.

476
00:12:05,740 --> 00:12:07,550
If you mention your phone

477
00:12:07,550 --> 00:12:08,570
number in your bio,

478
00:12:08,600 --> 00:12:09,860
add it to your Facebook

479
00:12:09,860 --> 00:12:11,720
profile as well and check

480
00:12:11,720 --> 00:12:13,040
that shoppers can see it.

481
00:12:13,610 --> 00:12:15,290
Listing Additions doesn't

482
00:12:15,290 --> 00:12:16,930
update your profile for you.

483
00:12:17,990 --> 00:12:19,210
Now look at the complete

484
00:12:19,210 --> 00:12:20,230
finished listing.

485
00:12:20,970 --> 00:12:22,110
The vehicle features

486
00:12:22,110 --> 00:12:24,210
and optional emojis come first,

487
00:12:24,270 --> 00:12:25,710
followed by dealership

488
00:12:25,710 --> 00:12:27,100
information and the closing

489
00:12:27,100 --> 00:12:28,120
contact line.

490
00:12:28,650 --> 00:12:29,930
This example also

491
00:12:29,930 --> 00:12:31,310
shows fee wording.

492
00:12:31,930 --> 00:12:33,330
Read the whole description

493
00:12:33,330 --> 00:12:35,090
after posting to make sure

494
00:12:35,090 --> 00:12:36,350
it says what you intended.

495
00:12:36,350 --> 00:12:38,400
For practice,

496
00:12:38,420 --> 00:12:40,580
draft one shared dealership line

497
00:12:40,580 --> 00:12:42,660
and one personal closing line.

498
00:12:42,960 --> 00:12:43,980
Read them together

499
00:12:43,980 --> 00:12:45,900
and remove any duplication.

500
00:12:46,993 --> 00:12:48,033
This lesson is for the

501
00:12:48,033 --> 00:12:49,753
person managing the dealership's

502
00:12:49,753 --> 00:12:50,773
AutoLander access.

503
00:12:51,073 --> 00:12:52,343
Start in the left

504
00:12:52,343 --> 00:12:54,503
sidebar and click Configuration.

505
00:12:54,543 --> 00:12:55,983
Then choose Team.

506
00:12:56,353 --> 00:12:57,773
Find the teammate's row.

507
00:12:58,143 --> 00:13:00,023
Posting Access and Manager

508
00:13:00,023 --> 00:13:01,343
Dashboard Access are

509
00:13:01,343 --> 00:13:02,363
separate choices.

510
00:13:02,913 --> 00:13:04,253
A rep who publishes

511
00:13:04,253 --> 00:13:05,893
vehicles needs posting access.

512
00:13:06,213 --> 00:13:08,213
A manager who only reviews

513
00:13:08,213 --> 00:13:10,013
activity may need dashboard

514
00:13:10,013 --> 00:13:11,693
access without posting access.

515
00:13:12,313 --> 00:13:13,353
Match the settings

516
00:13:13,353 --> 00:13:14,553
to that person's job.

517
00:13:15,113 --> 00:13:16,353
To add someone new,

518
00:13:16,393 --> 00:13:17,693
choose Invite Member.

519
00:13:17,693 --> 00:13:19,053
Enter the correct

520
00:13:19,053 --> 00:13:20,193
email and the role

521
00:13:20,193 --> 00:13:21,673
details shown in the form.

522
00:13:22,033 --> 00:13:23,333
Check your plan's seat

523
00:13:23,333 --> 00:13:24,673
arrangements before sending.

524
00:13:25,103 --> 00:13:26,223
Each person should

525
00:13:26,223 --> 00:13:27,443
use their own login.

526
00:13:27,833 --> 00:13:29,293
Ask the teammate to check

527
00:13:29,293 --> 00:13:30,853
their inbox and spam folder,

528
00:13:30,853 --> 00:13:32,333
then follow the invitation.

529
00:13:32,863 --> 00:13:33,883
Have them sign

530
00:13:33,883 --> 00:13:34,913
in and show you

531
00:13:34,913 --> 00:13:35,933
the page they need.

532
00:13:36,153 --> 00:13:37,253
That checks both

533
00:13:37,253 --> 00:13:39,093
the invitation and their access.

534
00:13:39,373 --> 00:13:40,983
If a rep can't find

535
00:13:40,983 --> 00:13:42,663
the inventory or posting page,

536
00:13:42,783 --> 00:13:43,813
check their account

537
00:13:43,813 --> 00:13:44,833
and access first.

538
00:13:45,163 --> 00:13:46,623
Use the existing account

539
00:13:46,623 --> 00:13:48,143
instead of creating a duplicate.

540
00:13:48,143 --> 00:13:49,663
If the issue

541
00:13:49,663 --> 00:13:51,813
concerns seats or billing, check

542
00:13:51,813 --> 00:13:53,113
the subscription separately.

543
00:13:53,453 --> 00:13:55,373
Now compare two roles

544
00:13:55,373 --> 00:13:57,173
in your workbook: a posting

545
00:13:57,173 --> 00:13:58,433
rep and a manager

546
00:13:58,433 --> 00:13:59,993
who only reviews the team.

547
00:14:00,463 --> 00:14:01,723
Write down the access

548
00:14:01,723 --> 00:14:02,763
each one needs.

549
00:14:02,993 --> 00:14:04,563
Leave the live settings as

550
00:14:04,563 --> 00:14:05,943
they are during this exercise.

551
00:14:07,260 --> 00:14:08,620
Click Manager Dashboard

552
00:14:08,620 --> 00:14:09,640
in the left sidebar.

553
00:14:10,060 --> 00:14:11,740
Start with the reporting period.

554
00:14:12,090 --> 00:14:13,110
Choose Today,

555
00:14:13,220 --> 00:14:15,000
This Week or This Month.

556
00:14:15,410 --> 00:14:16,670
Use the same period

557
00:14:16,670 --> 00:14:17,850
when comparing activity.

558
00:14:18,670 --> 00:14:19,690
Read the label

559
00:14:19,690 --> 00:14:20,710
on each number.

560
00:14:20,900 --> 00:14:22,620
Posting activity, active

561
00:14:22,620 --> 00:14:24,280
listings and sold reporting

562
00:14:24,280 --> 00:14:25,660
tell you different things.

563
00:14:26,340 --> 00:14:27,380
A reported sale

564
00:14:27,380 --> 00:14:28,600
is useful context,

565
00:14:28,740 --> 00:14:30,460
but that number alone doesn't

566
00:14:30,460 --> 00:14:31,860
explain what led to it.

567
00:14:32,170 --> 00:14:33,210
If a teammate's

568
00:14:33,210 --> 00:14:34,390
activity looks low,

569
00:14:34,430 --> 00:14:36,050
start with a simple question.

570
00:14:36,440 --> 00:14:37,460
What happened

571
00:14:37,460 --> 00:14:38,480
with your last post?

572
00:14:38,480 --> 00:14:39,850
Ask them

573
00:14:39,850 --> 00:14:41,190
to open Post to Market

574
00:14:41,190 --> 00:14:42,490
and show you the Queue.

575
00:14:43,060 --> 00:14:44,380
If the task stopped,

576
00:14:44,600 --> 00:14:45,700
check the connection

577
00:14:45,700 --> 00:14:47,080
and inventory together.

578
00:14:47,840 --> 00:14:49,000
Can't find the page?

579
00:14:49,390 --> 00:14:51,790
Go to Configuration, then Team,

580
00:14:51,790 --> 00:14:53,030
and check their access.

581
00:14:53,920 --> 00:14:55,280
If the setup is ready

582
00:14:55,280 --> 00:14:56,600
but a step is unclear,

583
00:14:56,840 --> 00:14:58,200
replay that lesson.

584
00:14:58,630 --> 00:14:59,890
Let the teammate show

585
00:14:59,890 --> 00:15:01,000
you the step afterwards.

586
00:15:01,660 --> 00:15:03,240
Agree on one useful

587
00:15:03,240 --> 00:15:05,280
next action, such as checking

588
00:15:05,280 --> 00:15:07,060
a failed row or confirming

589
00:15:07,060 --> 00:15:08,080
the correct inventory.

590
00:15:08,960 --> 00:15:10,060
Follow up on that

591
00:15:10,060 --> 00:15:11,420
action during the next shift.

592
00:15:11,420 --> 00:15:13,620
In your workbook,

593
00:15:13,620 --> 00:15:14,640
choose a reporting

594
00:15:14,640 --> 00:15:16,260
period and one metric.

595
00:15:16,600 --> 00:15:17,900
Write the question you

596
00:15:17,900 --> 00:15:19,030
would ask, and the next

597
00:15:19,030 --> 00:15:20,410
task you would check together.

598
00:15:21,527 --> 00:15:22,827
Your subscription's posting

599
00:15:22,827 --> 00:15:24,427
allowance and your optional

600
00:15:24,427 --> 00:15:26,287
AI credits do different jobs.

601
00:15:26,537 --> 00:15:27,637
Let's find both.

602
00:15:27,797 --> 00:15:29,257
If you manage billing,

603
00:15:29,297 --> 00:15:30,477
click Configuration

604
00:15:30,477 --> 00:15:32,457
in the sidebar, then Billing.

605
00:15:32,527 --> 00:15:34,047
Review the plan and current

606
00:15:34,047 --> 00:15:35,147
terms for your account.

607
00:15:35,577 --> 00:15:36,717
The Pro plan's current

608
00:15:36,717 --> 00:15:38,017
allowance is up to fifteen

609
00:15:38,017 --> 00:15:39,877
posts a day.

610
00:15:40,327 --> 00:15:41,587
Other plans and team

611
00:15:41,587 --> 00:15:42,707
arrangements can differ,

612
00:15:42,707 --> 00:15:43,967
so use the allowance

613
00:15:43,967 --> 00:15:45,307
that belongs to your account.

614
00:15:45,487 --> 00:15:46,887
In Post to Market,

615
00:15:46,967 --> 00:15:48,227
check the posts remaining

616
00:15:48,227 --> 00:15:49,867
today before choosing a batch.

617
00:15:49,867 --> 00:15:51,027
That remaining

618
00:15:51,027 --> 00:15:52,467
number is not the same

619
00:15:52,467 --> 00:15:53,867
as your AI credit balance.

620
00:15:54,047 --> 00:15:55,167
AI Background

621
00:15:55,167 --> 00:15:56,607
options show their credit

622
00:15:56,607 --> 00:15:58,107
cost alongside the choice.

623
00:15:58,517 --> 00:15:59,877
Leaving the option off

624
00:15:59,877 --> 00:16:01,277
uses the original photos.

625
00:16:01,707 --> 00:16:02,767
Choosing a treatment

626
00:16:02,767 --> 00:16:04,367
uses the applicable credits.

627
00:16:04,487 --> 00:16:05,567
A credit pack

628
00:16:05,567 --> 00:16:07,577
adds AI credits; it doesn't

629
00:16:07,577 --> 00:16:09,017
automatically raise your plan's

630
00:16:09,017 --> 00:16:10,127
daily posting allowance.

631
00:16:10,307 --> 00:16:11,767
If you want to purchase

632
00:16:11,767 --> 00:16:13,837
credits or change plans, review

633
00:16:13,837 --> 00:16:15,137
the current amount and terms

634
00:16:15,137 --> 00:16:16,587
in the app before confirming.

635
00:16:16,947 --> 00:16:17,967
There's no purchase

636
00:16:17,967 --> 00:16:19,207
required for this lesson.

637
00:16:19,207 --> 00:16:20,817
On a dealer account,

638
00:16:20,957 --> 00:16:22,057
ask your manager

639
00:16:22,057 --> 00:16:23,337
about billing or limits.

640
00:16:23,417 --> 00:16:24,997
On an individual account,

641
00:16:25,137 --> 00:16:26,637
contact the AutoLander

642
00:16:26,637 --> 00:16:27,977
admin if the plan information

643
00:16:27,977 --> 00:16:28,997
needs clarification.

644
00:16:29,357 --> 00:16:30,617
For practice,

645
00:16:30,677 --> 00:16:32,117
explain the difference between

646
00:16:32,117 --> 00:16:34,187
posts remaining and AI credits,

647
00:16:34,187 --> 00:16:35,207
and find where

648
00:16:35,207 --> 00:16:36,227
you would check each.

649
00:16:37,227 --> 00:16:38,267
Use manual selection

650
00:16:38,267 --> 00:16:39,507
when you have particular

651
00:16:39,507 --> 00:16:40,727
vehicles in mind.

652
00:16:40,987 --> 00:16:42,407
Choose them in Post to

653
00:16:42,407 --> 00:16:44,007
Market and start that batch.

654
00:16:44,187 --> 00:16:45,627
Use Auto-Pilot

655
00:16:45,627 --> 00:16:46,927
for the ongoing routine.

656
00:16:47,687 --> 00:16:48,947
Let's find its settings.

657
00:16:49,637 --> 00:16:50,837
Click Post to Market

658
00:16:50,837 --> 00:16:52,077
in the left sidebar.

659
00:16:52,527 --> 00:16:53,917
Find Auto-Pilot,

660
00:16:53,917 --> 00:16:55,627
then choose Configure.

661
00:16:56,107 --> 00:16:57,707
Set the start and stop

662
00:16:57,707 --> 00:16:59,127
times for your posting window.

663
00:16:59,747 --> 00:17:01,777
Choose which inventory to use,

664
00:17:01,777 --> 00:17:03,227
then your photo options.

665
00:17:03,677 --> 00:17:04,997
Read the message about

666
00:17:04,997 --> 00:17:06,607
the window and your account's

667
00:17:06,607 --> 00:17:07,627
daily allowance.

668
00:17:07,627 --> 00:17:09,497
When the settings are right,

669
00:17:09,497 --> 00:17:11,027
turn Auto-Pilot on.

670
00:17:11,547 --> 00:17:12,587
Check that it shows

671
00:17:12,587 --> 00:17:13,687
an active state.

672
00:17:13,787 --> 00:17:15,667
It spreads posting across

673
00:17:15,667 --> 00:17:16,727
your chosen window,

674
00:17:16,727 --> 00:17:17,747
so you don't have

675
00:17:17,747 --> 00:17:19,227
to start each batch yourself.

676
00:17:19,527 --> 00:17:21,307
It also keeps existing

677
00:17:21,307 --> 00:17:22,687
listings up to date.

678
00:17:23,207 --> 00:17:24,467
When a price changes

679
00:17:24,467 --> 00:17:25,767
in your connected inventory,

680
00:17:26,087 --> 00:17:27,547
Auto-Pilot can update

681
00:17:27,547 --> 00:17:29,047
the matching Facebook listing

682
00:17:29,047 --> 00:17:30,587
posted through AutoLander.

683
00:17:30,607 --> 00:17:32,007
When a vehicle

684
00:17:32,007 --> 00:17:33,847
is marked sold, it handles

685
00:17:33,847 --> 00:17:35,747
the supported sold update too.

686
00:17:35,747 --> 00:17:37,157
You don't need

687
00:17:37,157 --> 00:17:38,177
to sit on the Listing

688
00:17:38,177 --> 00:17:39,547
Updates page and watch.

689
00:17:39,647 --> 00:17:41,747
Keep the computer powered on

690
00:17:41,747 --> 00:17:43,127
and connected to the internet,

691
00:17:43,127 --> 00:17:44,647
with AutoLander running.

692
00:17:45,237 --> 00:17:46,857
You can minimize the app.

693
00:17:47,187 --> 00:17:48,887
Closing it or shutting down

694
00:17:48,887 --> 00:17:50,607
the computer stops that work.

695
00:17:51,107 --> 00:17:52,487
On a laptop, make

696
00:17:52,487 --> 00:17:54,047
sure the computer stays awake.

697
00:17:54,597 --> 00:17:56,157
Check the app each day,

698
00:17:56,157 --> 00:17:57,417
and again after

699
00:17:57,417 --> 00:17:59,097
a restart or lost connection.

700
00:17:59,907 --> 00:18:01,107
Confirm Facebook,

701
00:18:01,247 --> 00:18:04,027
the feed and Auto-Pilot, then

702
00:18:04,027 --> 00:18:06,087
read any unfinished Queue items.

703
00:18:06,557 --> 00:18:08,197
Which mode fits your day?

704
00:18:08,197 --> 00:18:10,357
Note that in your workbook,

705
00:18:10,357 --> 00:18:11,607
then find the schedule

706
00:18:11,607 --> 00:18:12,627
on your own screen.

707
00:18:13,247 --> 00:18:14,267
Change the live

708
00:18:14,267 --> 00:18:15,337
settings only when

709
00:18:15,337 --> 00:18:16,507
you're ready to use them.

710
00:18:17,227 --> 00:18:18,247
For groups,

711
00:18:18,247 --> 00:18:19,447
start in Configuration

712
00:18:19,447 --> 00:18:21,257
and click My Groups.

713
00:18:21,257 --> 00:18:22,957
With Facebook connected,

714
00:18:23,197 --> 00:18:24,917
choose Load From Facebook

715
00:18:24,917 --> 00:18:26,017
to see the groups

716
00:18:26,017 --> 00:18:27,317
available from your account.

717
00:18:27,807 --> 00:18:28,967
Select the relevant

718
00:18:28,967 --> 00:18:30,067
