719
00:18:30,067 --> 00:18:31,287
groups you want to use,

720
00:18:31,287 --> 00:18:33,337
then choose Save Groups.

721
00:18:33,337 --> 00:18:34,467
Pick groups

722
00:18:34,467 --> 00:18:35,487
that fit your area

723
00:18:35,487 --> 00:18:36,977
and the vehicles you sell.

724
00:18:37,187 --> 00:18:38,367
Read their rules.

725
00:18:38,607 --> 00:18:39,787
Group administrators

726
00:18:39,787 --> 00:18:41,607
still decide what gets approved.

727
00:18:41,887 --> 00:18:43,187
Your choices don't

728
00:18:43,187 --> 00:18:44,227
guarantee that a post

729
00:18:44,227 --> 00:18:45,427
will appear in that group.

730
00:18:45,737 --> 00:18:46,937
You can come back here

731
00:18:46,937 --> 00:18:48,077
to review your choices.

732
00:18:48,077 --> 00:18:50,327
For an older Marketplace

733
00:18:50,327 --> 00:18:52,147
listing, first check that

734
00:18:52,147 --> 00:18:53,527
the vehicle is still available

735
00:18:53,527 --> 00:18:55,387
and its information is current.

736
00:18:55,617 --> 00:18:57,297
Then click Post

737
00:18:57,297 --> 00:18:58,677
to Market in the sidebar

738
00:18:58,677 --> 00:19:01,077
and choose Posted to FB,

739
00:19:01,077 --> 00:19:03,637
next to Available and Queue.

740
00:19:04,217 --> 00:19:05,237
Find the vehicle

741
00:19:05,237 --> 00:19:07,017
and choose Repost.

742
00:19:07,037 --> 00:19:08,807
The blue Delete

743
00:19:08,807 --> 00:19:10,407
and Repost control appears.

744
00:19:10,667 --> 00:19:12,407
This removes the original

745
00:19:12,407 --> 00:19:13,707
listing published through

746
00:19:13,707 --> 00:19:15,537
AutoLander and creates a fresh

747
00:19:15,537 --> 00:19:16,707
listing for that vehicle.

748
00:19:16,707 --> 00:19:18,647
It isn't simply an edit

749
00:19:18,647 --> 00:19:19,717
to the old description,

750
00:19:19,747 --> 00:19:21,027
and it doesn't guarantee

751
00:19:21,027 --> 00:19:22,167
a particular place

752
00:19:22,167 --> 00:19:23,227
in a shopper's feed.

753
00:19:23,307 --> 00:19:25,617
For practice, locate your group

754
00:19:25,617 --> 00:19:26,977
settings and the Posted

755
00:19:26,977 --> 00:19:27,997
to FB tab.

756
00:19:28,327 --> 00:19:29,707
Explain what Delete

757
00:19:29,707 --> 00:19:31,547
and Repost does, without

758
00:19:31,547 --> 00:19:33,487
deleting or reposting a vehicle

759
00:19:33,487 --> 00:19:34,567
just for the lesson.

760
00:19:35,627 --> 00:19:37,167
AI Background is optional.

761
00:19:37,207 --> 00:19:38,227
It changes

762
00:19:38,227 --> 00:19:39,527
the setting around a vehicle

763
00:19:39,527 --> 00:19:40,807
