764
00:19:41,117 --> 00:19:42,417
This is the original

765
00:19:42,417 --> 00:19:44,037
image beside the finished

766
00:19:44,037 --> 00:19:45,497
result for the same vehicle.

767
00:19:45,577 --> 00:19:47,057
To choose a style,

768
00:19:47,057 --> 00:19:48,457
click Configuration

769
00:19:48,457 --> 00:19:49,637
in the left sidebar.

770
00:19:49,967 --> 00:19:51,937
Open Post Style, then

771
00:19:51,937 --> 00:19:53,237
find the background choices.

772
00:19:53,697 --> 00:19:54,807
Select the style

773
00:19:54,807 --> 00:19:55,827
you want to use.

774
00:19:56,077 --> 00:19:57,157
Now click Post

775
00:19:57,157 --> 00:19:58,437
to Market in the sidebar.

776
00:19:58,787 --> 00:20:00,027
On the vehicle card,

777
00:20:00,047 --> 00:20:01,567
find AI Background.

778
00:20:02,027 --> 00:20:03,047
First Photo

779
00:20:03,047 --> 00:20:04,217
changes the lead image.

780
00:20:04,217 --> 00:20:05,417
The other options

781
00:20:05,417 --> 00:20:07,057
cover more exterior photos.

782
00:20:07,497 --> 00:20:09,117
Before starting the post,

783
00:20:09,237 --> 00:20:10,417
read the credit cost

784
00:20:10,417 --> 00:20:11,557
beside your choice.

785
00:20:11,717 --> 00:20:13,317
Prefer the original photos?

786
00:20:13,477 --> 00:20:15,457
Leave AI Background off.

787
00:20:15,577 --> 00:20:16,837
You'll see the generated

788
00:20:16,837 --> 00:20:18,117
result after posting.

789
00:20:18,417 --> 00:20:19,777
Open the finished Marketplace

790
00:20:19,777 --> 00:20:21,397
listing and check that

791
00:20:21,397 --> 00:20:22,597
the image still represents

792
00:20:22,597 --> 00:20:23,877
the vehicle accurately.

793
00:20:24,117 --> 00:20:25,617
If something is wrong,

794
00:20:25,737 --> 00:20:27,137
have the listing corrected.

795
00:20:27,587 --> 00:20:28,787
Dealer-account users

796
00:20:28,787 --> 00:20:30,007
can tell their manager;

797
00:20:30,187 --> 00:20:31,627
individual users can

798
00:20:31,627 --> 00:20:33,267
contact the AutoLander admin.

799
00:20:33,267 --> 00:20:35,057
For this exercise,

800
00:20:35,197 --> 00:20:36,317
find the style

801
00:20:36,317 --> 00:20:37,717
and First Photo controls

802
00:20:37,717 --> 00:20:39,157
without starting a post.

803
00:20:39,277 --> 00:20:40,977
Then compare the original

804
00:20:40,977 --> 00:20:42,797
and finished photos shown here.

805
00:20:43,087 --> 00:20:44,167
Your workbook has

806
00:20:44,167 --> 00:20:45,337
space to note the option

807
00:20:45,337 --> 00:20:46,357
and its cost.

808
00:20:47,427 --> 00:20:48,467
If a task stops,

809
00:20:48,567 --> 00:20:49,797
read the message before

810
00:20:49,797 --> 00:20:50,817
changing settings.

811
00:20:51,397 --> 00:20:52,417
Open the Queue

812
00:20:52,417 --> 00:20:54,047
and find the affected vehicle.

813
00:20:54,907 --> 00:20:56,107
Failed means there's

814
00:20:56,107 --> 00:20:57,147
a message to check.

815
00:20:57,817 --> 00:20:58,837
Processing means

816
00:20:58,837 --> 00:21:00,217
the job is still working.

817
00:21:00,597 --> 00:21:01,897
Give that job time

818
00:21:01,897 --> 00:21:03,577
instead of adding it again.

819
00:21:04,497 --> 00:21:06,097
If Facebook needs to reconnect,

820
00:21:06,277 --> 00:21:07,857
start in the left sidebar.

821
00:21:08,577 --> 00:21:09,897
Click Configuration.

822
00:21:10,407 --> 00:21:11,927
Open the Facebook tab,

823
00:21:11,967 --> 00:21:13,887
