824
00:21:14,367 --> 00:21:15,637
Complete the sign-in

825
00:21:15,637 --> 00:21:16,657
steps privately.

826
00:21:17,407 --> 00:21:18,707
Back in AutoLander,

827
00:21:18,707 --> 00:21:19,827
check Facebook Connected

828
00:21:19,827 --> 00:21:20,847
