829
00:21:20,847 --> 00:21:22,827
Review the affected job

830
00:21:22,827 --> 00:21:24,647
before retrying it, and leave

831
00:21:24,647 --> 00:21:26,247
successful vehicles alone.

832
00:21:26,487 --> 00:21:29,067
If vehicles are missing, first

833
00:21:29,067 --> 00:21:30,667
clear the search and filters

834
00:21:30,667 --> 00:21:31,827
in Post to Market.

835
00:21:32,397 --> 00:21:33,417
Still missing?

836
00:21:33,467 --> 00:21:34,867
Click Configuration

837
00:21:34,867 --> 00:21:35,987
in the left sidebar.

838
00:21:36,417 --> 00:21:38,217
Choose Inventory Feeds

839
00:21:38,217 --> 00:21:39,697
and check the connected source.

840
00:21:40,027 --> 00:21:41,047
Make sure it's

841
00:21:41,047 --> 00:21:42,067
the right dealership

842
00:21:42,067 --> 00:21:43,237
before changing anything.

843
00:21:43,877 --> 00:21:45,337
For Auto-Pilot, check

844
00:21:45,337 --> 00:21:47,207
four things: is it on,

845
00:21:47,207 --> 00:21:48,777
is it within the posting

846
00:21:48,777 --> 00:21:50,777
window, is the computer online,

847
00:21:50,777 --> 00:21:53,017
and is AutoLander running?

848
00:21:53,547 --> 00:21:54,567
Read any

849
00:21:54,567 --> 00:21:55,587
warning on the screen.

850
00:21:55,687 --> 00:21:57,407
If you still need help,

851
00:21:57,427 --> 00:21:58,787
record what you tried,

852
00:21:58,887 --> 00:22:00,047
what you expected

853
00:22:00,087 --> 00:22:01,567
and the exact message.

854
00:22:01,667 --> 00:22:03,007
Add the time

855
00:22:03,007 --> 00:22:04,257
and a screenshot without

856
00:22:04,257 --> 00:22:05,277
private information.

857
00:22:05,527 --> 00:22:07,347
To find the app version,

858
00:22:07,407 --> 00:22:08,447
click Configuration,

859
00:22:08,587 --> 00:22:09,727
