865
00:22:19,447 --> 00:22:21,107
Use the workbook's help form

866
00:22:21,107 --> 00:22:22,507
to practice writing a clear

867
00:22:22,507 --> 00:22:23,687
report for this example.

868
00:22:24,983 --> 00:22:26,003
Start each day with a

869
00:22:26,003 --> 00:22:27,413
quick check in AutoLander.

870
00:22:27,553 --> 00:22:29,213
Confirm Facebook is connected,

871
00:22:29,353 --> 00:22:30,803
your inventory is right,

872
00:22:30,803 --> 00:22:31,833
and any unfinished

873
00:22:31,833 --> 00:22:33,133
Queue items make sense.

874
00:22:33,393 --> 00:22:35,213
If you're using Auto-Pilot,

875
00:22:35,213 --> 00:22:36,493
check that it's on and

876
00:22:36,493 --> 00:22:37,793
the app can keep running.

877
00:22:37,913 --> 00:22:39,233
If you work manually,

878
00:22:39,313 --> 00:22:40,573
choose the vehicles you

879
00:22:40,573 --> 00:22:41,763
want to post and review

880
00:22:41,763 --> 00:22:42,783
Listing Updates.

881
00:22:42,993 --> 00:22:45,033
Then check Facebook Messenger.

882
00:22:45,353 --> 00:22:46,653
That's where shopper

883
00:22:46,653 --> 00:22:48,053
conversations come to you.

884
00:22:48,423 --> 00:22:49,443
AutoLander handles

885
00:22:49,443 --> 00:22:50,503
the posting routine;

886
00:22:50,723 --> 00:22:52,123
you handle the conversation.

887
00:22:52,693 --> 00:22:53,993
Open Messenger on

888
00:22:53,993 --> 00:22:55,213
your computer or phone,

889
00:22:55,213 --> 00:22:57,313
and keep notifications on so

890
00:22:57,313 --> 00:22:58,553
