894
00:23:05,093 --> 00:23:06,333
Let's finish with the tasks

895
00:23:06,333 --> 00:23:07,453
you'll use, not

896
00:23:07,453 --> 00:23:08,933
just the lessons you've watched.

897
00:23:09,253 --> 00:23:10,393
Open your workbook

898
00:23:10,393 --> 00:23:12,053
