901
00:23:16,453 --> 00:23:17,653
or not your role.

902
00:23:18,233 --> 00:23:19,373
For a salesperson,

903
00:23:19,423 --> 00:23:20,443
check that you can

904
00:23:20,443 --> 00:23:21,493
